      "message": "fix(examples): regenerate the first router part after the tabbed contour entry change\n\nCommit ac03087a3 (PR #3684) changed where a tabbed outside 2D Contour\nstarts its untabbed levels. The committed demo kept the old cached path\nof 2D Contour1, so first_router_part failed at the comparison with the\ncommand build.\n\nRegenerated by the documented commands: WRITE_GOLDEN=1 on\nfirst_router_part, then camcraft-cli process for the .nc. The posted\nprogram changes only in the 2D Contour1 section.\n\nFixes #3698\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
